NAME: system test
PURPOSE: This is a series of a few simple questions to check responses.
DIRECTORY: system_test
---
# Keyboard off for the whole run - [ASK] and [PAUSE] below each silently
# turn it on for themselves and restore this setting when done, so nothing
# else in the script needs to think about it.
[KEYBOARD_INPUT:off]
# TTS off too, just for this first section - unlike keyboard, nothing
# auto-restores this one, so it's turned back on explicitly below.
[TTS_OUTPUT:off]
turn off all the lights.
Ask the user for the name of a dog.
[ASK]What is a name for a dog?
what was the previous word?

[TTS_OUTPUT:on]
# Timer, lights, and basic facts check
Set a timer for 30 seconds and when the timer goes off, blink any light.
turn all the lights back on.
show the numbers 1 through 10
what time is it?
what is the opposite of up?
what is 2 + 2?

# Web search, then wrap up
what is the weather like in New York City right now?
how many eggs are in a dozon eggs.
[PAUSE]wait
Announce the system test is complete.
